+// MUL_MAT_ID of q4_K / q5_K experts for prompt processing with fp16 math (p60-moe-gemm.cu). Returns false if not
+// applicable. Needs GGML_CUDA_P60_MEGA=1; GGML_CUDA_P60_MOE_GEMM=0 disables it.
